      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hartland%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the Public Land Survey System, Hartland lies near the midpoint between Sections 22 and 23 of Township 45 North, Range 6 East.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
