      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/il/hartland-xx-mchenry-profile.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hartland Township’s administrative hub is located on Nelson Road in Woodstock, where residents attend monthly board meetings.",
